<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse index little changed in thin trade.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse index little changed in thin trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange on Monday closed little changed in thin trade, bourse sources said.</p>
<p>The market's 30-share index closed at 597.34 from 597.23 on Friday.</p>
<p>Trade volume was 207,499 dinars against two million dinars.</p>
<p>Retail stores Monoprix  MONO.TN was down 1.23 dinar to 39.64 dinars. ($=0.97 dinar)</p>
